        "Description": "47\rWe received a message from our XC Contact that Orson Mills, Alma Reynard and their closest bodyguard Gerald Mann work on a computer virus to infiltrate our client&apos;s server structure and leak sensitive materials to the public.\rXC requested to ensure that the death of Mills, former IT specialist at XC, must look like an accident while ensuring it is indeed lethal.\r\rGood Luck\r\r-XC Contact-\rD-R-A-W-F-Y",
